        },
        {
          "text": "Kur’ uwo musi Uhoraho azohanisha inkota yiwe ikarishe nini ikomeye Lewiyatani ca kiyoka kinyaruka, ni co Lewiyatani ca kiyoka cigonyonzora, kand’ azokwica ca gisato c’amahēro co mu kiyaga.",
          "type": "text",
